WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.901 --> 00:00:02.300
-Welcome back, everybody.

00:00:02.300 --> 00:00:04.234
We are hanging out with
Kareem Abdul-Jabbar right here.

00:00:04.234 --> 00:00:06.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:06.334 --> 00:00:09.601
Kareem, you're a legend
both on and off the court,

00:00:09.601 --> 00:00:12.000
so I thought you could help me
settle some of the biggest

00:00:12.000 --> 00:00:14.133
and most important debates ever.

00:00:14.133 --> 00:00:15.300
-Okay.
-You ready to do this?

00:00:15.300 --> 00:00:17.000
All right, it is time for
"Kareem Abdul-Jabbar

00:00:17.000 --> 00:00:18.701
Settles It."

00:00:18.701 --> 00:00:20.667
-♪ Kareem Abdul-Jabbar
settles it ♪

00:00:20.667 --> 00:00:23.334
♪ Kareem Abdul-Jabbar
settles it ♪

00:00:23.334 --> 00:00:25.667
-All right. Here we go.

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:26.801
First up.

00:00:31.100 --> 00:00:33.267
-Indoor because it won't rain
and you --

00:00:33.267 --> 00:00:34.601
the sun won't beat you up.

00:00:34.601 --> 00:00:36.033
-Yeah. There you go.

00:00:36.033 --> 00:00:38.267
That's the game.
That's a great answer.

00:00:38.267 --> 00:00:39.801
[ Applause ]

00:00:42.534 --> 00:00:44.734
-Popsicles when I want to
think about learning the game

00:00:44.734 --> 00:00:47.334
uptown when I was a kid.

00:00:47.334 --> 00:00:51.167
And ice cream when I want to get
emotional about watching

00:00:51.167 --> 00:00:52.701
the movie "Titanic."

00:00:52.701 --> 00:00:55.767
[ Laughter ]

00:00:55.767 --> 00:00:58.767
[ Applause ]

00:01:01.334 --> 00:01:02.734
-That's correct.

00:01:07.534 --> 00:01:09.667
-Oh, geez, roller coasters.

00:01:09.667 --> 00:01:12.501
Water slides are nothing
but outdoor bidets.

00:01:12.501 --> 00:01:15.501
[ Laughter ]

00:01:15.501 --> 00:01:18.067
[ Cymbal crashes ]

00:01:18.701 --> 00:01:20.000
-Yeah, yeah.

00:01:20.000 --> 00:01:22.667
You build up enough speed --
Yeah, you're right, yeah.

00:01:22.667 --> 00:01:24.300
Oh, how about this?
This is interesting.

00:01:24.300 --> 00:01:26.634
Ooh, I think I know the answer
to this one.

00:01:30.434 --> 00:01:33.400
-The tears of the 1985 Celtics

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:34.901
when they lost to the Lakers
in the finals.

00:01:34.901 --> 00:01:35.767
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:35.767 --> 00:01:38.868
[ Drumroll ]

00:01:38.868 --> 00:01:43.334
♪♪

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:48.067
[ Laughter ]

00:01:48.067 --> 00:01:50.834
-Oh, my gosh.

00:01:50.834 --> 00:01:52.601
I was going to say mustard,
but --

00:01:52.601 --> 00:01:55.467
[ Laughter ]

00:01:55.467 --> 00:01:58.000
Oh, this one -- I think
I know the answer to this one.

00:02:01.100 --> 00:02:03.100
-No way, man.

00:02:03.100 --> 00:02:06.267
-Yeah. Yeah, no.
-That's like putting --

00:02:06.267 --> 00:02:08.467
that's like putting anchovies
on Jell-O.

00:02:08.467 --> 00:02:10.701
-[ Laughs ] Yeah, don't do that.

00:02:10.701 --> 00:02:12.701
Let's go into movies --
summer movies.

00:02:14.734 --> 00:02:17.300
-"Minions" because they copied
my goggles.

00:02:17.300 --> 00:02:18.868
-Oh, yeah. That's right, yeah.

00:02:18.868 --> 00:02:19.901
-My signature goggles.

00:02:19.901 --> 00:02:20.901
-Your signature --
that's right.

00:02:20.901 --> 00:02:22.501
Yeah, okay.
Good, you're right.

00:02:25.801 --> 00:02:28.567
-I'd rather have a choice
between either of them.

00:02:28.567 --> 00:02:31.434
[ Laughter ]

00:02:34.901 --> 00:02:37.934
-"Star Wars." I always wanted to
play a giant monster in a movie

00:02:37.934 --> 00:02:41.200
and for Chewbacca,
it's not going to be hard

00:02:41.200 --> 00:02:42.667
to learn his lines.

00:02:42.667 --> 00:02:48.067
-[ Laughs ] J.J., George Lucas,
you watching this? Come on.

00:02:51.467 --> 00:02:53.501
-Coleslaw.
People don't want to be near me

00:02:53.501 --> 00:02:55.767
anytime I've had a bowl
of baked beans.

00:02:55.767 --> 00:02:58.767
[ Laughter ]

00:03:05.000 --> 00:03:07.367
-Slam dunk if I want
to intimidate.

00:03:07.367 --> 00:03:09.767
Skyhook if I want to show people
they can't stop me

00:03:09.767 --> 00:03:11.467
if they tried.

00:03:11.467 --> 00:03:14.467
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:15.434 --> 00:03:18.734
-And then I have to ask
you this.

00:03:18.734 --> 00:03:20.300
Finally, once and for all...

00:03:25.200 --> 00:03:27.100
[ Audience oohs ]

00:03:27.100 --> 00:03:28.434
Oh, come on. You have to answer.
-No, no, no.

00:03:28.434 --> 00:03:29.968
-You have to answer.
You have to answer.

00:03:29.968 --> 00:03:34.000
-I'll answer.
The G.O.A.T. --

00:03:34.000 --> 00:03:37.234
the G.O.A.T. Committee
meets in secret, okay?

00:03:37.234 --> 00:03:38.734
[ Laughter ]

00:03:38.734 --> 00:03:43.400
So...

00:03:43.400 --> 00:03:46.934
That's just something we're not
going to know about, you know?

00:03:46.934 --> 00:03:52.000
But if Lebron breaks my record
this next year coming up,

00:03:52.000 --> 00:03:54.634
that will be one last record

00:03:54.634 --> 00:03:57.167
that I won't have to worry about
ever again.

00:03:57.167 --> 00:04:00.234
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:07.801
-Okay.
But the greatest of all time?

00:04:07.801 --> 00:04:09.000
Can I just say it?

00:04:09.000 --> 00:04:10.100
-Why not?

00:04:10.100 --> 00:04:11.801
-Kareem Abdul-Jabbar.

00:04:11.801 --> 00:04:14.868
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:04:14.868 --> 00:04:18.601
My thanks to
Kareem Abdul-Jabbar.

00:04:18.601 --> 00:04:21.667
More information about his
charity, the Skyhook Foundation,

00:04:21.667 --> 00:04:24.734
can be found at
kareemabduljabbar.com.

00:04:24.734 --> 00:04:26.467
We'll be right back
with Kristen Bell.

